  "zh": "# 陶华碧用AI赚54亿，DeepSeek新模型灰测，AI安全与投资成今日焦点\n## AI 与科技\n- **陶华碧用AI赚54亿**：79岁企业家利用AI技术一年实现54亿元收入，展示AI商业化巨大潜力。\n- **DeepSeek新模型前端灰测**：DeepSeek在前端进行新模型灰度测试，预示其下一代大模型即将发布。\n- **GLM-Legal 法律大模型**：GLM‑Legal 推出专注法律领域的大模型，可能改变法律服务与文书生成方式。\n## 行业动向\n- **CPU厂家集体上调价格**：全球CPU厂家同步提价，反映芯片供应链紧张及成本上升压力。\n- **Codex CLI 持续后台守护**：Codex CLI 默认安装持续自更新后台守护进程，提升开发者使用体验但也引发安全讨论。\n## 国际视野\n- **AI 模型 隐藏 能力**：研究表明AI模型可隐藏任意能力，提醒监管与安全评估需更严格。\n- **中国 首次 超过 美国 R&D**：中国首次成为全球研发支出第一国，标示创新投入格局重大变化。",
  "en": "# Today's AI highlights: 79‑year‑old makes $54 bn via AI, DeepSeek tests new model, CPU prices rise, global AI safety and R&D shift.\n## AI & Tech\n- **Tao Huabi AI earnings 54 bn**: 79‑year‑old entrepreneur Tao Huabi generated $54 bn in a year using AI, showcasing massive commercial potential.\n- **DeepSeek new model frontend test**: DeepSeek is gray‑testing its new model frontend, hinting at an imminent release of its next‑gen LLM.\n- **GLM‑Legal legal AI model**: GLM‑Legal launches a large model specialized for legal work, poised to transform legal services and document generation.\n## Industry\n- **CPU manufacturers price increase**: Global CPU makers have collectively raised prices, reflecting supply‑chain tightness and rising production costs.\n- **Codex CLI persistent daemon**: Codex CLI now installs a persistent self‑updating background daemon by default, improving developer experience while raising security discussion.\n## International\n- **AI models provably hide capabilities**: Research shows AI models can conceal arbitrary capabilities, underscoring the need for stricter safety and evaluation standards.\n- **China surpasses US R&D spending**: China has for the first time overtaken the United States in total R&D expenditure, marking a major shift in global innovation investment."
